<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Storeco profit down with Specialty.</title>
<headline>Storeco profit down with Specialty.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>13 months vs pro-forma previous 13 months</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, (cts)		16.2	  vs  20.9</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 5.7	   vs  5.7</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   17.80	 vs  22.88</p>
<p>Div payable</p>
<p>on register June 27</p>
<p>Full name: Storeco Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it would offer capitalisation shares. Shareholders can elect to receive a cash dividend instead.</p>
<p>The capital employed of Storeco is almost entirely represented by its investment Specialty Stores Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
